<title>USA: San Antonio feeder cattle prices fully steady-USDA.</title>
<headline>San Antonio feeder cattle prices fully steady-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers under 600 lbs were fully steady, over 600 lbs $2.00-$3.00 per cwt higher, compared to last week, USDA said</p>
<p>Bulk of supply Medium and Large 1-2 300-600 lb feeder steers and heifers. Supply included around 10 percent cows and bulls, 25 percent feeder cattle over 600 lbs. Receipts - 557 Last Week - 614   Last Year - 1,884.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers - Medium and Large 1 - 500-600 lbs 80.00-90.00, few 91.00-94.00; 600-700 lbs 73.50-84.00; 700-800 lbs 73.00-78.50; pkg 805 lbs 69.00. Medium and Large 1-2 - 500-600 lbs 74.00-77.00; 700-825 lbs 67.00-70.00.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers - Medium and Large 1 - 600-700 lbs 71.50-78.50; pkg 725 lbs 69.50.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
